The CSP solver remains CPU-bound under current shared-machine load, but it is making progress rather than hanging. I’m keeping the 5-million-node threshold because it is the evidence behind Track A; lowering it just to shorten the test would recreate the weak-baseline problem the task explicitly warns against.
