A second harness attempt reached the other two vendors as well; Anthropic and xAI returned the same account-level 403, confirming this is not a model-specific outage. The README now documents the block and the untried paper-specific MILP/max-clique solvers as caveats. A fresh final local self-test is running against the revised 12/13/14 ladder.
