README.md:20:Generation is inverse, never search-based. At the shipping settings the generator samples every internal grid edge independently, copies its color to the two incident planted tiles, puts gray only around the frame, then independently rotates and permutes the tiles. Thus the certificate is carried through known transformations. All internal edges come from one distribution; there is no separate planted-edge or decoy-edge population. The first post-ladder escalation keeps the 196-code answer fixed and shuffles an exactly balanced color multiset, removing frequency outliers before any board-size increase.
